{"ticker":"HII","updated":"2026-10-23T23:04:20Z","profile":{"longName":"Huntington Ingalls Industries, Inc.","shortName":"Huntington Ingalls Industries, ","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","country":"United States","website":"https://www.hii.com","fullTimeEmployees":45000,"marketCap":10800012288,"trailingPE":16.333729,"forwardPE":13.043986,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.81911355,"pegRatio":0.85,"targetMeanPrice":356.41666,"targetHighPrice":406.0,"targetLowPrice":281.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":12,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.109,"earningsGrowth":0.365,"grossMargins":0.124,"operatingMargins":0.0708,"profitMargins":0.05013,"totalRevenue":13185000448,"beta":0.21,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":460.0,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":255.36,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.02},"summary":"Huntington Ingalls Industries, Inc. designs, builds, overhauls, and repairs military ships in the United States. It operates through three segments: Ingalls, Newport News, and Mission Technologies. The company is involved in the design and construction of non-nuclear ships comprising amphibious assault ships, surface combatants, and national security cutters for the U.S. Navy and U.S. Coast Guard. It also provides nuclear-powered ships, such as aircraft carriers and submarines, as well as refueling and overhaul, and inactivation services of nuclear-powered aircraft carriers. In addition, the company offers naval nuclear support services, including fleet services comprising design, construction, maintenance, and disposal activities for in-service the U.S. Navy nuclear ships; and maintenance services on nuclear reactor prototypes. Further, the company provides C5ISR systems and operations; application of artificial intelligence and machine learning to battlefield decisions; defensive and offensive cyberspace strategies and electronic warfare; uncrewed autonomous systems; live, virtual, and constructive solutions; platform modernization; and critical nuclear operations. The company has a strategic partnership with HD Hyundai Heavy Industries to implement intelligent mechanized welding systems at Huntington Ingalls Industries, Inc.'s Ingalls Shipbuilding division. Huntington Ingall","summary_zh":"亨廷頓英格斯工業公司在美國設計、建造、大修和修理軍艦。它透過三個部門運作：Ingalls、Newport News 和 Mission Technologies。該公司參與為美國海軍和美國海岸防衛隊設計和建造非核艦艇，包括兩棲攻擊艦、水面戰鬥艦和國家安全巡邏艇。它也提供航空母艦、潛艦等核動力船舶，以及核動力航空母艦的加油、大修、失能服務。此外，該公司還提供海軍核子支援服務，包括為現役美國海軍核艦艇提供設計、建造、維護和處置活動的艦隊服務；核反應器原型的維護服務。此外，該公司還提供C5ISR系統和營運；人工智慧和機器學習在戰場決策中的應用；防禦性和進攻性網路空間策略和電子戰；無人自主系統；即時、虛擬和建設性的解決方案；平台現代化；和關鍵的核行動。該公司與 HD Hyundai Heavy Industries 建立了戰略合作夥伴關係，在 Huntington Ingalls Industries, Inc. 的 Ingalls 造船部門實施智慧機械化焊接系統。亨廷頓·英格爾","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"航空航太與國防","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":270.53,"h":271.63,"l":269.73,"c":270.72,"v":342600},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":270.1,"h":273.7,"l":269.14,"c":271.74,"v":432700},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":271.56,"h":276.91,"l":271.31,"c":276.39,"v":393200},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":276.4,"h":277.31,"l":273.04,"c":275.27,"v":448100},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":274.69,"h":276.19,"l":270.37,"c":270.79,"v":363900},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":269.64,"h":272.26,"l":267.51,"c":269.71,"v":453600},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":270.29,"h":270.32,"l":266.6,"c":269.33,"v":456400},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":268.5,"h":270.53,"l":267.17,"c":269.98,"v":385600},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":270.14,"h":271.33,"l":266.0,"c":271.13,"v":362700},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":270.87,"h":271.02,"l":265.44,"c":269.94,"v":399600},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":269.3,"h":269.71,"l":264.0,"c":267.07,"v":431800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":267.52,"h":273.71,"l":267.18,"c":271.93,"v":408500},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":272.19,"h":276.93,"l":272.19,"c":276.07,"v":295200},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":277.51,"h":277.74,"l":274.06,"c":274.71,"v":217100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":273.13,"h":276.59,"l":270.81,"c":273.02,"v":504600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":274.29,"h":276.91,"l":270.29,"c":273.19,"v":609400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":272.86,"h":274.87,"l":271.43,"c":272.46,"v":3