-22","zh":"贏得新海軍合約後亨廷頓英格斯工業公司 (HII) 是否合理？"},{"title":"Huntington Ingalls Industries (HII) Projected to Post Quarterly Earnings on Thursday","src":"MarketBeat","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"亨廷頓英格斯工業公司 (HII) 預計將於週四公佈季度收益"},{"title":"HD Hyundai, Kiewit to form US ship block JV, possibly 1st MASGA project","src":"KED Global","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE1JZnQza09VSWI3eHVUeldTSlhxazlQV1E5Y1g0dmVNSEFTT3pSdnZ3ajdaTFU0ZEJ3NkJSa05lR3pfVmNpRVpZRDI0VWdpbW44ZWs3YTBHQklvRXZoR0VqNXZDWld3ZzVubVJaOEhMWHFIcGNyb3VUbWlRQkY?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"HD Hyundai 和 Kiewit 將組成美國船舶區塊合資企業，可能是第一個 MASGA 項目"},{"title":"For $99 million, the U.S. Navy will conduct more tests on its second destroyer modernized for hypersonic missiles","src":"Zona Militar","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"美國海軍將斥資 9,900 萬美元對其第二艘現代化高超音速飛彈驅逐艦進行更多測試"},{"title":"Lyndon B. Johnson Gets $99M CPS Hypersonic Sea-Trial Deal","src":"Envanter Medya","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxNNUFVY1h3dnJuWUwxcVdxZjk0ckRkbzFvS01NTE4wdWVfUVZvRWN2RnNuTWx2aTJWWmJ6ZnFJQ2daYjBlcDZEWVF6UW5YcVpyYVdCQ3NBb19mTlZleTRmUnU0bFhkM3dadnowTm9GV2tjX2lPQkRuNzlTVkU3Ti1iZg?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"Lyndon B. Johnson 獲得價值 9900 萬美元的 CPS 高超音速海試合約"}],"themes":[{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":5},{"name":"財報","count":4},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":4},{"name":"國防/軍工","count":3},{"name":"減重藥/生技","count":2}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-05","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1501585/000150158526000006/hii-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Huntington Ingalls Industries, Inc. (\"HII\", the \"Company\", \"we\", \"us\", or \"our\") is a global, all-domain defense partner, building and delivering the world's most powerful, survivable naval ships and technologies that safeguard America's seas, sky, land, space, and cyber. For more than a century, our Ingalls Shipbuilding segment (\"Ingalls\") in Mississippi and Newport News Shipbuilding segment (\"Newport News\") in Virginia have built more ships in more ship classes than any other U.S. naval shipbuilder, making us America's largest shipbuilder. Our Mission Technologies segment develops integrated technology solutions and products that enable today's connected, all-domain force. Headquartered in Newport News, Virginia, we employ over 44,000 people domestically and internationally.","zh":"亨廷頓英格斯工業公司（「HII」、「公司」、「我們」、「我們」或「我們的」）是一家全球性的全領域國防合作夥伴，致力於建造和提供世界上最強大、生存能力最強的海軍艦艇和技術，以保護美國的海洋、天空、陸地、太空和網路。一個多世紀以來，我們密西西比州的英格斯造船部門（“英格爾斯”）和弗吉尼亞州的紐波特紐斯造船部門（“紐波特紐斯”）建造的船舶數量比任何其他美國海軍造船廠都多，使我們成為美國最大的造船廠。我們的任務技術部門開發整合技術解決方案和產品，以實現當今互聯的全局部隊。我們的總部位於維吉尼亞州紐波特紐斯，在國內外擁有超過 44,000 名員工。"},{"en":"We conduct most of our business with the U.S. Government, primarily the Department of War (the \"Department\"). As prime contractor, principal subcontractor, team member, or partner, we participate in many high-priority U.S. defense programs. Ingalls includes our non-nuclear ship design, construction, repair, and maintenance businesses. Newport News includes all of our nuclear ship design, construction, overhaul, refueling, and repair and maintenance businesses. Our Mission Technologies segment provides a wide range of services and products, including command, control, computers, communications, cyber, intelligence, surveillance, and reconnaissance (\"C5ISR\") systems and operations; the application of artificial intelligence and machine learning to battlefield decisions; defense and offensive cyberspace strategies and electronic warfare; unmanned autonomous systems; live, virtual, and const","zh":"我們的大部分業務都是與美國政府（主要是陸軍部）進行的。作為主承包商、主要分包商、團隊成員或合作夥伴，我們參與了許多高度優先的美國國防專案。英格斯包括我們的非核能船舶設計、建造、修理和維護業務。紐波特紐斯包括我們所有的核子船舶設計、建造、大修、加油以及維修和保養業務。我們的任務技術部門提供廣泛的服務和產品，包括指揮、控制、電腦、通訊、網路、情報、監視和偵察（「C5ISR」）系統和操作；人工智慧和機器學習在戰場決策中的應用；防禦和進攻性網路空間戰略和電子戰；無人自主系統；即時、虛擬和常量"},{"en":"Through our Ingalls segment, we design and construct non-nuclear ships for the U.S. Navy and U.S. Coast Guard, including amphibious assault ships, surface combatants, and national security cutters (\"NSC\"). We are the sole builder of amphibious assault ships and one of two builders of surface combatants for the U.S. Navy. Our Ingalls segment is located in Pascagoula, Mississippi on 800 acres along the Pascagoula River.","zh":"透過我們的英格斯部門，我們為美國海軍和美國海岸防衛隊設計和建造非核艦艇，包括兩棲攻擊艦、水面戰鬥艦和國家安全巡邏艦（「NSC」）。我們是唯一的兩棲攻擊艦建造商，也是美國海軍的兩家水面戰艦建造商之一。我們的英格斯分會位於密西西比州帕斯卡古拉，位於帕斯卡古拉河沿岸，佔地 800 英畝。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Our revenues are primarily derived from the U.S. Government, including the U.S. Navy, the U.S. Coast Guard, the Department, the DoE, and other federal agencies. In 2025, 2024, and 2023, approximately 81%, 80%, and 81%, respectively, of our revenues were generated from the U.S. Navy.","zh":"我們的收入主要來自美國政府，包括美國海軍、美國海岸防衛隊、國防部、能源部和其他聯邦機構。 2025 年、2024 年和 2023 年，我們約 81%、80% 和 81% 的收入分別來自美國海軍。"},{"en":"We develop new technologies, manufacturing processes, and systems-integration processes. In addition to owning our intellectual property, we license intellectual property rights to and from third parties. The U.S. Government generally receives license rights to certain intellectual property developed in the performance of U.S. Government contracts or with government funding and may use or authorize other parties to use such intellectual property. While our intellectual property rights are important to our operations, we do not believe that any existing patent, license, or other intellectual property right is of such importance that its loss or termination would have a material adverse impact on our business. See Risk Factors in Item 1A for further discussion regarding risks related to intellectual property.","zh":"我們開發新技術、製造流程和系統整合製程。除了擁有我們的知識產權之外，我們還向第三方授權知識產權。美國政府通常會獲得在履行美國政府合約或政府資助下開發的某些智慧財產權的許可權，並且可以使用或授權其他方使用此類智慧財產權。雖然我們的智慧財產權對我們的營運很重要，但我們認為任何現有的專利、授權或其他智慧財產權的重要性都不會高到其遺失或終止會對我們的業務產生重大不利影響。有關知識產權相關風險的進一步討論，請參閱第 1A 項中的風險因素。"}],"competition":[{"en":"We operate in a competitive environment and compete with defense companies and other companies serving the intelligence and federal civil markets.","zh":"我們在競爭激烈的環境中運營，並與國防公司和其他服務於情報和聯邦民用市場的公司競爭。"},{"en":"Our Newport News and Ingalls segments compete primarily with General Dynamics and, in the case of certain non-nuclear shipbuilding programs, smaller shipyards. Intense competition related to programs, resources, funding, and long operating cycles are key characteristics of both our shipbuilding business and the shipbuilding defense industry in general.","zh":"我們的紐波特紐斯和英格斯部門主要與通用動力公司競爭，就某些非核子造船項目而言，與較小的造船廠競爭。與專案、資源、資金和長營運週期相關的激烈競爭是我們造船業務和整個造船國防工業的關鍵特徵。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Newport News Shipbuilding","val":6507000000,"zh":"紐波特紐斯造船廠"},{"name":"Ingalls","val":3078000000,"zh":"英格爾斯"},{"name":"Mission Technologies","val":3044000000,"zh":"使命技術"}],"total":12484000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Product","val":8133000000,"zh":"產品"},{"name":"Service","val":4351000000,"zh":"服務"}],"total":12484000000}},"peers":["LHX","LDOS","NOC","TDG","GD"]}}